menu "Sound player"

    config SOUND_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi SSID"
        default ""

    config SOUND_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password"
        default ""

    config SOUND_API_URL
        string "Random sound URL"
        default ""
        help
            The webapp's /api/random endpoint. Each button press adds its color
            (red, blu, yel or grn) as ?color=, and gets back a WAV picked at random
            from the playlist the webapp has mapped to that button.

endmenu
